<BaseLayout title="NBS Stereo Research | Jianguo Shu" active="projects">
<a class="link link-primary text-sm" href="/projects/">← All projects</a><p class="section-label mt-9">Stereo Vision · Research Reproduction</p><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-3">NBS: No Bias Stereo</h1>
<p class="text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70 mt-6">An ongoing reproduction and experimental study of deep stereo matching, including architecture, optimization, evaluation, and generalization across test conditions.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-6"><span class="badge badge-outline">PyTorch</span><span class="badge badge-outline">Stereo Matching</span><span class="badge badge-outline">Depth Estimation</span></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12">Research focus</h2><p class="leading-8 mt-4">Studying attention-based representations, high-resolution modeling, and disparity prediction in modern stereo methods. The objective is careful experimentation rather than presenting an incomplete reproduction as the published system.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10">Evaluation status</h2><p class="leading-8 text-base-content/70 mt-4">Verified benchmark results, qualitative disparity maps, and implementation details will be added when they are ready for public release. No unsupported benchmark claims are made here.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10">Reference</h2><a class="link link-primary inline-block mt-4" href="https://intrinsic-experimental.github.io/nbs-website/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original NBS project website ↗</a>
</BaseLayout>